Wong is a pioneer in photonic chip technology and is a leader in photonic chip integration. His research in photonic chip technology has led to advances in photonics and integrated optics. His achievements were honored in 2012 with the Henry Samueli Award for Excellence in Engineering from the UCLA Samueli School.
Wong is a Fellow of the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers and a Fellow of the American Institute of Electrical Engineers. He has received numerous awards and honors including: the 2015 IEEE Jules A. Horowitz Award for Excellence in Research; the 2015 IEEE Jules A. Horowitz Award for Excellence in Education; the 2013 IEEE Jules A. Horowitz Award for Excellence in Research; the 2013 IEEE Jules A. Horowitz Award for Excellence in Education; the 2013 Henry Samueli Award for Excellence in Engineering from the UCLA Samueli School; the 2013 Henry Samueli Award for Excellence in Teaching at UCLA;
